e cancelled for a day, pupils miss important topics and teachers struggle to «cover the curriculum». This can lead to stress before exams, thereby reducing results. For example, a student who misses a maths lesson may find the next topic difficult.","However, I am convinced that trips are worthwhile, mainly because they allow students to «learn through experience». By visiting museums, factories or nature reserves, pupils see real examples of what they study. As a result, they remember information better and become more interested in learning. Trips also «build teamwork». For instance, a class that visits a science museum together may discuss ideas and become closer friends.","In conclusion, although trips may interrupt lessons, I firmly believe that they are valuable because they make learning practical and strengthen relationships."],"chunks":[["a waste of time","vaqtni behuda sarflash"],["interrupt normal lessons","oddiy darslarni to‘xtatib qo‘ymoq"],["miss important topics","muhim mavzularni o‘tkazib yubormoq"],["cover the curriculum","o‘quv dasturini qamrab olmoq"],["fall behind","orqada qolmoq"],["stress before exams","imtihon oldi stressi"],["cancel classes","darslarni bekor qilmoq"],["learn through experience","tajriba orqali o‘rganmoq"],["visit museums","muzeylarga borishmoq"],["nature reserves","qo‘riqxonalar"],["see real examples","haqiqiy misollarni ko‘rmoq"],["remember information better","ma’lumotni yaxshiroq eslab qolmoq"],["become more interested in learning","o‘qishga ko‘proq qiziqmoq"],["build teamwork","jamoaviy ishlashni shakllantirmoq"],["become closer friends","yaqinroq do‘st bo‘lmoq"],["broaden one’s knowledge","bilimini kengaytirmoq"],["hands-on learning","amaliy o‘rganish"],["bring lessons to life","darslarni jonlantirmoq"],["a break from routine","kundalik tartibdan tanaffus"],["boost motivation","motivatsiyani oshirmoq"],["cultural experiences","madaniy tajribalar"],["expensive transport","qimmat transport"],["safety concerns","xavfsizlik bilan bog‘liq xavotirlar"],["supervise students","o‘quvchilarni nazorat qilmoq"],["organise a trip","sayohat tashkil etmoq"],["cost parents money","ota-onaga pulga tushmoq"],["unfair to poorer families","kambag‘alroq oilalar uchun adolatsiz"],["educational value","ta’limiy qiymat"],["a memorable day","unutilmas kun"],["practical knowledge","amaliy bilim"]],"wc":180},{"n":17,"q":"Some people think companies should spend money on events for their staff, while others believe this money should be used to increase salaries. What is your opinion?","kind":"Opinion","title":"Staff events or higher salaries","essay":["Nowadays, many companies must decide how to spend money on their employees. While staff events can improve team spirit, I believe that higher salaries are more useful.","There are several reasons why companies organise events, one of which is that they «boost team spirit». When colleagues relax together at a party or a trip, they build trust and «communicate more openly». This often improves cooperation at work, thereby increasing productivity. For example, a team that spends a weekend hiking together may solve problems faster afterwards.","However, I am convinced that higher salaries are better, mainly because they «motivate employees» more effectively. By earning more, workers can pay their bills, save money and support their families. As a result, they feel valued, which reduces stress and staff turnover. Events, in contrast, benefit people only for a day. For instance, an employee who receives a ten per cent raise enjoys it every month of the year.","In conclusion, although staff events can improve team spirit, I firmly believe that companies should use this money to increase salaries because it motivates workers in a lasting way."],"chunks":[["organise events for staff","xodimlar uchun tadbirlar tashkil etmoq"],["boost team spirit","jamoa ruhini ko‘tarmoq"],["build trust","ishonch o‘rnatmoq"],["communicate more openly","ochiqroq muloqot qilmoq"],["improve 