nsport is a better investment, mainly because it «reduces air pollution». By travelling by bus, metro or tram, thousands of commuters leave their cars at home. As a result, the air becomes cleaner and fewer people suffer from breathing problems. Public transport is also affordable. For instance, a student can reach university for a small fee, while owning a car costs far more.","In conclusion, although new roads can reduce congestion, I firmly believe that governments should invest more in public transport because it is cleaner, cheaper and available to everyone."],"chunks":[["spend money on public transport","jamoat transportiga pul sarflamoq"],["build new roads","yangi yo‘llar qurmoq"],["reduce traffic jams","tirbandlikni kamaytirmoq"],["wider highways","kengroq magistrallar"],["journey times","yo‘lda bo‘lish vaqti"],["deliver goods on time","tovarlarni o‘z vaqtida yetkazmoq"],["boost the economy","iqtisodiyotni rivojlantirmoq"],["a new bypass","yangi aylanma yo‘l"],["reduce air pollution","havo ifloslanishini kamaytirmoq"],["commuters","har kuni qatnovchilar"],["leave the car at home","mashinani uyda qoldirmoq"],["breathing problems","nafas olish muammolari"],["an affordable fare","arzon yo‘l haqi"],["cost far more","ancha qimmatga tushmoq"],["owning a car","mashinaga egalik qilish"],["a reliable service","ishonchli xizmat"],["a frequent service","tez-tez qatnaydigan xizmat"],["an efficient network","samarali tarmoq"],["ease congestion","tirbandlikni yengillashtirmoq"],["encourage people to use buses","odamlarni avtobusdan foydalanishga undamoq"],["cut carbon emissions","uglerod chiqindilarini qisqartirmoq"],["rush hour","tig‘iz soatlar"],["a long-term investment","uzoq muddatli sarmoya"],["accessible to everyone","hamma uchun ochiq"],["elderly and disabled people","keksa va nogiron odamlar"],["low-income families","daromadi past oilalar"],["attract more passengers","ko‘proq yo‘lovchini jalb qilmoq"],["a lack of parking spaces","to‘xtash joylari yetishmasligi"],["road accidents","yo‘l-transport hodisalari"],["create more traffic","ko‘proq tirbandlik keltirib chiqarmoq"]],"wc":182},{"n":28,"q":"Some people think every city should have more green spaces, while others believe this land should be used for housing and business. What is your opinion?","kind":"Opinion","title":"Green spaces vs housing","essay":["Nowadays, growing cities face a difficult choice between parks and new buildings. While cities need more homes and businesses, I believe that green spaces are more important.","There are several reasons why some people prefer housing, one of which is the «shortage of affordable homes». Because populations are growing, many families cannot afford to rent a flat in the centre. This can lead to overcrowding, thereby lowering the quality of life. For example, a young couple may share a small apartment with relatives because rents are too high.","However, I am convinced that green spaces are more valuable, mainly because they «improve public health». By walking, running or relaxing in parks, residents reduce stress and stay active. As a result, they suffer less from heart disease and depression. Trees also «clean the air». For instance, a city centre with a large park is usually cooler and less polluted in summer.","In conclusion, although cities need more homes and businesses, I firmly believe that green spaces should be protected because they support health and a cleaner environment."],"chunks":[["green spaces","yashil hududlar"],["housing and business","uy-joy va biznes"],["a shortage of affordable homes","arzon uylar yetishmasligi"],["the population is growing","aholi soni o‘smoqda"],["cannot afford to rent","ijaraga olishga qurbi yetmaslik"],["a flat in the centre","markazdagi kvartira"],["cause overcrowding","gavjumlikka sabab bo‘lmoq"],["lower the quality of life","hayot sifatini pasaytirmoq"],["a small apartment","kichik kvartira"],["rents are too high","ijara haqi juda baland"],["create jobs","ish o‘rinlari yaratmoq"],